<title>
Front Side Member (Partial) Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Hood lock member: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9B06001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
